# Kconfig CUA RIENG app __APP_NAME__ - TUY CHON, xoa file nay neu app khong
# can option rieng gi (khong loi gi ca neu thieu file - xem
# neon-mdf/Kconfig + cmake/kconfig.cmake, dong osource "optional source").
#
# Cac option khai bao o day se hien CUNG 1 menuconfig, gop chung 1
# sdkconfig/sdkconfig.h voi cac option cua SDK (components/driver) - mo qua
# CMake target `menuconfig` (VS Code: lenh "NEON-MDF: Menuconfig", CLI:
# neon_mdf.py menuconfig). Doc gia tri trong code C qua
# `#include "sdkconfig.h"` + macro CONFIG_<TEN>.
#
# Vi du (bo comment de dung - xoa doan nay neu khong can):
#
# menu "__APP_NAME__"
#
# config APP_EXAMPLE_OPTION
#     bool "Vi du 1 option bat/tat rieng cua app nay"
#     default y
#     help
#         Doc qua CONFIG_APP_EXAMPLE_OPTION trong Src/main.c (#include
#         "sdkconfig.h") - xem Projects/Examples/Blinky/Kconfig +
#         Src/main.c (CONFIG_BLINKY_DELAY_LOOPS) de xem 1 vi du THAT da
#         chay tren phan cung.
#
# endmenu
